      "bullets": [
        "Stylistic artifacts like synthetic enthusiasm, symmetrical structure, and telltale vocabulary make unedited LLM prose instantly recognizable and distracting to peers.",
        "Publishing raw GPT-4 or Claude output damages professional credibility, signaling a lack of genuine domain depth and critical thought.",
        "Effective AI-assisted technical communication demands aggressive human curation, voice preservation, and structural pruning rather than copy-pasting raw model generations."
